{"actor": "Brian J. McDermott", "authority": "PRIME.1; DEC-0035", "data": {"quote": "A13 is fine, it was my inconsistency due to the complexity around human recorded ledger entries. a tool to make this easier in the future should be considered. Another actor is fine to be me.", "ruled_on": "2026-10-20", "source": "decisions.md DEC-0035 (on develop)"}, "files": {}, "prev_sha256": "c11e65488fdabe8f46bdbb49b04db4c4efa07ae2c9e329ebadddbff5566f2669", "role": "human owner", "seq": 23, "summary": "Rulings: the A13 ordering of the output commit and the release entry is accepted; the owner as the regenerating actor satisfies v3 section 9 item 4", "type": "ruling", "utc": "2026-10-20T11:41:58+00:00"}
