{"actor": "Brian J. McDermott", "authority": "PRIME.1; DEC-0037", "data": {"quote": "for item 1, ideally we should have 2 more attractors with different properties for 10/28. higher dimensionality, or any qualitative departure from the 3 we picked is preferred. Item 2 is a strong goal, I agree. Item 3 is also a strong demonstration. Based on the research we did previously, integrate these items into the roadmap and plan so we can agressively start implmenting them. we want item 1 done by 10/22. The otehrs may be implemented concurrently. Concurrent to that, launch the ensemble study.", "ruled_on": "2026-10-20", "source": "decisions.md DEC-0037 (on develop)"}, "files": {}, "prev_sha256": "a4712e184d55880a35b099ad3e97c1d9df340d6d67c03469c336262c8242f5e7", "role": "human owner", "seq": 25, "summary": "Authorization of the extension program (additional attractors, Dysts context, development ensemble); new systems are a spin-off outside LPC.PC.1, development seeds only, never main", "type": "ruling", "utc": "2026-10-20T11:41:58+00:00"}
